Why this approach: ReverseProxy+Rewrite; hooks checked against go1.25.4 source and a throwaway run. Rewrite strips client X-Forwarded-*/cleans the query/re-adds Te (put back or dropped); ReverseProxy appends X-Request-Id (upstream's deleted); accessLog must log from a defer or aborted streams go unlogged.
Alternatives rejected: Director; SetXForwarded; hand-rolled proxy.
